      <exercise id="_0f0d59d2-2fcd-4daf-ac6a-c1ab9c931506" class="multiple-choice">
        <problem id="prob-00006">
          <para id="para-00028">Are the solutions you found using the two methods close?</para>
        </problem>
        <solution id="sol-00006">
          <para id="para-00029">Correct! Yes. Solutions were the same: \(x \approx 7.646\) and \(x \approx 2.354\).</para>
          <para id="para-00030">Incorrect. The correct answer is Yes. \(x \approx 7.646\) and \(x \approx 2.354\).</para>
        </solution>
